    "detailed_description": "A role playing game about growing plants to heal the environment in real time. Gather your crew, upgrade your ship, and build a better future for the inhabitants of the eight rings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2> <br><strong><u>Grow plants in a living world</u></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/593c4959a467f12faae18ccc9686d7fd.poster.avif?t=1740604897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/593c4959a467f12faae18ccc9686d7fd.webm?t=1740604897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/593c4959a467f12faae18ccc9686d7fd.mp4?t=1740604897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grow lush gardens and harvest plants from your farm in real time<br></li><li>Plants can heal you, recycle junk, create light, repel monsters and much more!<br></li><li>A complex ecological simulation controls the growth of plants // controls the flora and fauna of the game worlds</li></ul><br><br><strong><u>Friendship and romance</u></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/9344438c47b9f2f6ff1c428c48c6af37.poster.avif?t=1740604897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/9344438c47b9f2f6ff1c428c48c6af37.webm?t=1740604897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/9344438c47b9f2f6ff1c428c48c6af37.mp4?t=1740604897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A diverse and entertaining set of crew members to rescue who will hang out on your starship, all with their own quests<br></li><li>Friendship and romance any of them\u2026 unless you annoy them with your choices!</li></ul><br><br><strong><u>Explore and discover the universe</u></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/75ba9fa1d72b1454af47690cb91ec7d5.poster.avif?t=1740604897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/75ba9fa1d72b1454af47690cb91ec7d5.webm?t=1740604897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/870930/extras/75ba9fa1d72b1454af47690cb91ec7d5.mp4?t=1740604897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique setting in a ring system with over 100 fragment worlds to explore<br></li><li>More than 200 plants and 50 creatures to collect<br></li><li>Win gardening competitions<br></li><li>Rescue cute animal friends<br></li><li>Hatch animal eggs<br></li><li>Investigate magnetic storms<br></li><li>Defend towns from mysterious creatures</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grow LOTS of plants!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect rare meteorites after meteor storms<br></li><li>Use phosphorescent plants to light up the dark<br></li><li>Use carnivorous plants to defend your crops from bugs<br></li><li>Charge devices with solarflowers<br></li><li>Clean up the world with pollution-absorbing plants<br></li><li>Open greenhouses to find rare plants <br></li><li>Unlock mysterious sites with your plant collection<br></li><li>And many more!</li></ul>",
